WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.714
Product briefing: monthly migraine prevention.

2
00:00:04.164 --> 00:00:08.088
Briefing on monthly preventive treatment for episodic and chronic migraine.

3
00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:13.438
Irregular sleep, missed meals and dehydration are common triggers that patients can manage.

4
00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:17.498
Frequent use of acute medicines can itself cause daily headache.

5
00:00:17.948 --> 00:00:20.119
Migraine is a clinical diagnosis.

6
00:00:20.569 --> 00:00:24.540
Red flags should be excluded before attributing headache to migraine.
